! not_found: @nobody is neither a jail nor an address set of project main
! hint: List the kind to see the names, check --host and --remote, and check the spelling. (jailops explain not_found)
[exit 4]

$ jailops app allow db to @web
! usage: jailops app allow APP from SOURCE
! hint: run 'jailops app allow --help' for usage
[exit 2]

$ jailops app allow db
! usage: jailops app allow APP from SOURCE
! hint: run 'jailops app allow --help' for usage
[exit 2]

